                                "sense_id": "06b7eda0-9491-303c-8c6d-e571db946bb4",
                                "text": "како́е сви́нство они́ развели́ на ку́хне!",
                                "translation": "what a pigsty they made out of the kitchen!",
                                "english": "what a pigsty they made out of the kitchen!"
